# d_isclose takes a box, not a plain array.
== SOURCE
d_isclose "ab"
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Box a, found Char
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | d_isclose "ab"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |           ---- a string: a vector of Char
  = note: `d_isclose` has type Any a => Box a -> a
  = help: `e_nclose x` puts a value in a box
